'''Juliet Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] increases range, freeze duration, and decreases recharge time. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]].

