==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Princess Juliet Cat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Princes Wanted (Removed Combo)|Princes Wanted]].
*The English name & description contain direct references to the drama theatre act of [[wikipedia:Romeo and Juliet|Romeo and Juliet]] made by [[wikipedia:William Shakespeare|William Shakespeare]].
**Unlike the original story, where Juliet falls in love with Romeo, it turns out Romeo was instead "a total jerk".
*Juliet Cat's favorite book, "Pride, Prejudice and Haircuts", is a reference to the novel ''[[wikipedia:Pride and Prejudice|Pride and Prejudice]]''. Her Japanese description credits [[J.K. Bun Bun]] as its author.

